<title>UK: IRISH PERMANENT SETS 150 MLN MARK SEVEN-YEAR FRN.</title>
<headline>IRISH PERMANENT SETS 150 MLN MARK SEVEN-YEAR FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IRISH PERMANENT TREASURY LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  IRISH PERMANENT TREASURY PLC</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M LIBOR  MATURITY    20.AUG.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     ISSUE	99.855    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/IBCA A2/A	DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**US/UK/JP/FR/DE</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
